sis de culturas, estados de ánimo, géneros y estilos de vida. Sus parientes: el jazz estético de ECM, John Fahey, el minimalismo y la kosmische musik. Guitarra (Ackerman, Michael Hedges), piano (George Winston, Michael Jones), flauta (Paul Horn), arpa, cuerdas (David Darling) y percusión; conjuntos de cámara (Shadowfax, Turtle Island String Quartet); la electrónica de Los Ángeles (Michael Stearns, Kevin Braheny, Steve Roach, el más metafísico de los mensajeros cósmicos) y la sinfónica (Constance Demby, Novus Magnificat), Robert Rich. La world music de vanguardia: Jon Hassell (Dream Theory In Malaya), Paul Winter, Kitaro, Jeff Greinke, Mark Isham, Michael Brook, Forrest Fang, Jorge Reyes. En Alemania, Peter Frohmader y los herederos de la música cósmica.","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#new-age"},{"id":17947842630791,"name":"Revival new age","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":2008,"end":2017,"desc":"Con el regreso de los aparatos analógicos se reivindica la primera new age, la más próxima al ambient solemne de los setenta.","color":"#38bdf8","family":"Ambient y escucha","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#revival-new-age"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":264567270190494,"artist":"Michael Stearns","artist_id":212583039973607,"title":"Planetary Unfolding","year":1981,"ess":0,"yt":"SZxrMwtBZaY","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"New age y world music","scene_id":135695620098166,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#new-age","chapters":["Sección 5.19"],"pages":[[1,203,null]]},{"id":54548974714634,"artist":"Michael Stearns","artist_id":212583039973607,"title":"Lyra Sound Constellation","year":1983,"ess":0,"yt":"Z1W2Id4PE9g","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","aut